{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26288","headline":"五月六日发石头城步望前船示舍弟兼寄侯郎 · 沈亚之","name":"五月六日发石头城步望前船示舍弟兼寄侯郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客子去淮阳，逶迤别梦长。\n水关开夜锁，雾櫂起晨凉。\n烟月期同赏，风波勿异行。\n隐山曾撼橹，转濑指遥樯。\n蒲叶吴刀绿，筠筒楚粽香。\n因书报惠远，爲我忆檀郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}